<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><I>Acquisition
of ZentoAI Intelligent Technology Company Limited</I></FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On
September 11, 2026, Zenta Group Company Limited (&ldquo;ZTG&rdquo; or the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;) completed the acquisition of the entire
issued share capital of ZentoAI Intelligent Technology Company Limited (&ldquo;ZentoAI&rdquo;) (the &ldquo;ZentoAI Acquisition&rdquo;),
pursuant to a share purchase agreement dated September 9, 2026 (the &ldquo;SPA&rdquo;) among the Company, ZentoAI and the shareholders
of ZentoAI, including ZentoAI Company Limited.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">ZentoAI
is a limited liability company incorporated in Macau on November 22, 2022. ZentoAI is an artificial intelligence and big data technology
company focused on artificial intelligence research and development, digital-intelligence platform development and enterprise-grade artificial
intelligence applications. ZentoAI&rsquo;s platforms include FinSMarket, an artificial intelligence-driven U.S. equity research and analysis
platform, and Macwise, a smart-tourism and business-promotion platform for Macau. ZentoAI holds a 95% equity interest in Macwise Technology
Limited (&ldquo;Macwise Technology&rdquo;), a company incorporated in Macau on August 28, 2023, and a 100% equity interest in Macwise
(Jiangxi) Technology Limited (&ldquo;Macwise Jiangxi&rdquo;), a company incorporated in the People&rsquo;s Republic of China (the &ldquo;PRC&rdquo;)
on March 27, 2026. ZentoAI consolidates Macwise Technology and Macwise Jiangxi in its consolidated financial statements.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
consideration under the SPA comprised cash consideration of HKD10,000,000 (equivalent to $1,275,217) and the issuance of 12,278,340 restricted
Class A ordinary shares of ZTG (the &ldquo;Consideration Shares&rdquo;). For purposes of determining the purchase consideration, the
Consideration Shares are measured at their fair value on the acquisition date of $0.770 per share, or $9,454,322 in aggregate.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
ZentoAI Acquisition constitutes the acquisition of a significant business under Rule 3-05 of Regulation S-X, and the following financial
statements of ZentoAI are included as Exhibits 99.1 and 99.2 to the Company&rsquo;s Report on Form 6-K of which this unaudited
pro forma condensed combined financial information forms a part:</FONT></P>

