of the purchase consideration and the intangible asset acquired with the carrying amounts, which approximate fair value, of ZentoAI&rsquo;s
other assets and liabilities as of March 31, 2026, the date of the unaudited pro forma condensed combined balance sheet. Goodwill as
of the acquisition date therefore differs from the amount presented below to the extent that ZentoAI&rsquo;s net assets changed between
March 31, 2026 and the acquisition date. </FONT></P>

